{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/6eac5ca15892d07670a2633e647f375e.webp?t=1772122244\" width=615 height=59 /></span>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/7e1357076ec3508af7fb705c53ced1c3.poster.avif?t=1772122244\" width=614 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/7e1357076ec3508af7fb705c53ced1c3.webm?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/7e1357076ec3508af7fb705c53ced1c3.mp4?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br><strong>In the ruins of the apocalypse, survival is not just a choice\u2014it is an endless trial. This is a multiplayer online zombie survival game that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic world ruled by the undead and harsh environments. You will play as a survivor in this living hell, struggling to stay alive, exploring urban ruins, and facing extreme temperature shifts and various unknown threats.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/38693a3a88557e0d04208a0dad34ffe2.webp?t=1772122244\" width=615 height=59 /></span>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f761662e3ed91a97e440715e239e7ee0.poster.avif?t=1772122244\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f761662e3ed91a97e440715e239e7ee0.webm?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/f761662e3ed91a97e440715e239e7ee0.mp4?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br><strong>Overnight, a zombie outbreak erupts in your city, turning it into a living hell. As temperatures gradually drop, you manage to escape the initial chaos and resolve to return to your family. Thus begins your journey home\u2014relying only on a makeshift vehicle for shelter and the weapons in your hands to unravel the mysteries behind the crisis and find the key to escape this nightmare.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/8c7da815d9f2f05cce8de8779d1daffb.webp?t=1772122244\" width=615 height=59 /></span>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/43e45e0835dfa4c9146705bc1e3afb2c.poster.avif?t=1772122244\" width=614 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/43e45e0835dfa4c9146705bc1e3afb2c.webm?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174500/extras/43e45e0835dfa4c9146705bc1e3afb2c.mp4?t=1772122244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br><strong>You will explore this fallen world alone or with your companions\u2014building secure bases, growing crops to sustain yourself, repairing vehicles, crafting weapons, and venturing into dangerous strongholds and ruins. Gather resources, upgrade your gear, and do whatever it takes to survive in a world overrun by zombies and unknown horrors.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3174500?t=1772122244","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3174500?t=1772122244","capsule_image":"https://s